{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"jodi-long","name":"Jodi Long","birthDate":"1954-01-07","birthPlace":"Manhattan, New York, USA","bio":"​From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia.  \n\nJodi Long (born January 7, 1954) is an American actress.Long had roles in many feature films including Patty Hearst, RoboCop 3, Striking Distance and The Hot Chick. On television she appeared as a regular on such series as Cafe Americain, All American Girl and Miss Match, all of which were short-lived.\n\nIn addition to her credited roles, Long appeared uncredited in a brief black-and-white cut-scene in the music video for Bizarre Love Triangle by the British group New Order, directed by American artist Robert Longo, in which she argues with E. Max Frye (where she emphatically declares \"I don't believe in reincarnation because I refuse to come back as a bug or as a rabbit!\").\n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article  Jodi Long, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia.","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-16T12:28:54+00:00","tmdbId":44059,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/44059","credits":[{"id":"shang-chi","title":"Shang-Chi and the Legend of the Ten Rings","character":"Mrs. Chen"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/jodi-long.webp","filmography":[{"name":"Night Swim","year":2024,"character":"Lucy Summers","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/9kSBjQ7KvMpCsdTYJ8BFiCNiMp4.jpg"},{"name":"The Monkey King","year":2023,"character":"Wangmu (voice)","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/i6ye8ueFhVE5pXatgyRrZ83LBD8.jpg"},{"name":"Shang-Chi and the Legend of the Ten Rings","year":2021,"character":"Mrs. Chen","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/9f2Q0U3IOsLgrI2HkvldwSABZy5.jpg"},{"name":"Dash & Lily","year":2020,"character":"Mrs. Basil E","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/eqBW1sqUxtOf1arBUAWNPJP5msD.jpg"},{"name":"The Mandalorian","year":2019,"character":"Warl